      "short_description": "Enter the Rhythm Dimension. A homage to classic arcade rhythm games (Guitar Hero, DDR), with a modern aesthetic and soundtrack. Match colours and beats, spin, tap, flick and flow through the juiciest beats in the universe. Supports multiple control styles including MIDI DJ gear on Steam!",
      "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Japanese, Portuguese - Brazil, Simplified Chinese, Traditional Chinese, Korean, Russian<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support",
      "reviews": "“If this is your first time playing a rhythm game, I’m envious. If you’re an old pro at them, get ready for something different but very enjoyable.”<br>Polygon<br><br>“Spin Rhythm XD is an all time great rhythm game - and yet I never hear anyone talking about it!”<br>Rock Paper Shotgun<br><br>“It’s a game of minimal distraction and high precision, designed to make you feel absolutely connected to the track you’re playing.”<br>IGN AU<br>",
